      },
      "ground_truth": "Known Click PR #1693. Trigger: an option with Choice(['Au', 'al', 'Bc'], case_sensitive=False) is shell-completed with incomplete 'a'. Parameter.shell_complete delegates to self.type.shell_complete; the old Choice.shell_complete uses case-sensitive startswith and omits 'Au'. Accept only a finding linking that dynamic type call to the missing case-insensitive match. The case_sensitive=True control should still offer only 'al'.",
      "references": [
        "https://github.com/pallets/click/pull/1693",
        "https://github.com/pallets/click/issues/1692",
        "https://github.com/pallets/click/commit/5eb46cba463ff3e3894b58f6649c5a13f02a70b1",
