      },
      "ground_truth": "Known Click PR #2365. Trigger: an Option uses Choice(['foo', 'bar']) with show_choices=False and its help metavar is built through Parameter.make_metavar. The old Choice.get_metavar exposes '[foo|bar]' despite show_choices=False; the intended type metavar is '[TEXT]'. Accept only a finding linking the dynamic self.type.get_metavar call to the ignored show_choices flag, not unrelated help formatting.",
      "references": [
        "https://github.com/pallets/click/pull/2365",
        "https://github.com/pallets/click/issues/2356",
        "https://github.com/pallets/click/commit/1a4d8c1bb1e8f8e214ede7223bd2c05dc2ce006a",
